BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Harvest Paint and SIp
DTSTART:20260918T210000Z
DTEND:20260919T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T130751Z
UID:5110513bb5561d98aeae195b52a02c2cdae4adee@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Art,Wine
DESCRIPTION:Event by Corning's Gaffer District and Pop & Paint\n1 West Mar
 ket Street\, Corning\, NY\nPublic\nHarvest Paint and Sip on Centerway Pede
 strian Bridge with Kylene Kiah\nJoin us for a fun and relaxed Paint and Si
 p session on the Centerway Pedestran Bridge! Whether you're an experienced
  painter or picking up a brush for the first time\, Kylene will guide you 
 step-by-step as you create your own Harvest-inspired piece to take home.\n
 Sip wine from Point of the Bluff Vineyards while you paint and enjoy the a
 tmosphere of Harvest happening throughout Downtown Corning. Bring your par
 tner\, friend(s) or come solo—either way\, it's all about good times and
  great art!\nTicket Includes\nA two-hour guided painting experience with K
 ylene Kiah\nAll painting supplies and materials\nOne complimentary glass o
 f wine from Point of the Bluff Vineyards\nYour completed artwork to take h
 ome\nAdmission to the private Paint & Sip area on the Pedestrian Bridge\nA
 dditional glasses of wine will be available for purchase throughout the ev
 ent.\nEvent Schedule\n5:00 PM – Wine service opens\n5:30 PM – Painting
  begins\n7:30 PM – Guided painting concludes\n8:00 PM – Wine service c
 loses\nA Unique Harvest Experience\nWith only 50 tickets available\, this 
 special event offers an enjoyable way to experience Harvest.\nCome early t
 o explore Harvest\, then grab a glass\, pick up a paintbrush\, and create 
 something memorable on Corning's Pedestrian Bridge.\nSpace is limited — 
 advance tickets are strongly encouraged.\nMust be 21 or older to consume a
 lcoholic beverages. Valid photo ID required.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466290/20260918170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466290/20260918170000
END:VEVENT
