 tember 18th\nDinner & Gallery Show\nEnjoy an enchanting evening with dinne
 r followed by a live gallery-style mediumship event where messages from lo
 ved ones may come through! Elevate your experience with VIP seating and ex
 clusive perks for an even more memorable night.\nSaturday\, September 19th
 \nMystic Market\nSpend the day exploring a magical marketplace filled with
  gifted psychic mediums offering private one-on-one readings\, along with 
 unique vendors featuring crystals\, handmade jewelry\, candles\, spiritual
  tools\, metaphysical gifts\, wellness products and more.\nWhether you are
  seeking guidance\, healing or simply curious about the mystical Mystic Ma
 rket offers an unforgettable experience filled with inspiration\, connecti
 on and wonder.\nDiscover what the universe has been waiting to tell you.\n
