 s of different ages and interests!\nThe Batman Day Pop Market runs from 10
 :00 AM to 4:00 PM and will feature comic creators\, artists\, crafters\, a
 nd more.\nAdmission is free.\nStop by our table between 10:00 and 2:00\, s
 ay hello\, and pick out a free book to take home and keep!\n#FamilyReading
