BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Doll Up Like Dolly!
DTSTART:20260925T220000Z
DTEND:20260926T035959Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T130751Z
UID:5124abcd2d3b4cc196a56d886061b28af9553b6d@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Causes,Community
DESCRIPTION:Y’all ready to pour yourself a cup of ambition?\nWe are thro
 wing the ultimate Doll Up Like Dolly Party\, and you’re invited to Latit
 ude 42 (Old Ithaca Road Horseheads) on September 25th aka Dolly Day from 6
 -9p.\nIt is time to tease your hair\, put on your finest rhinestones\, and
  channel your inner country music queen.\nHere are the details:\nThe Dress
  Code: Full-on Dolly. Think big blonde wigs\, fringe\, sequins\, denim\, o
 r your favorite iconic Dolly look or just a Dolly shirt or wear some of Do
 lly's favorite colors.\nThe Admission Fee: One book! Entry requires bringi
 ng a new or gently used children's book to be donated to local kids throug
 h the Family Reading Partnership of Chemung Valley.\nWhile you're there\, 
 we'll have Chey's Pierogi and The Magician's Kitchen with Dolly Themed coo
 kies.\nCome ready for a night of celebrating the literal queen of country!
