DESCRIPTION:Join us for our 48th Annual Heritage Festival as we celebrate 
 our nation’s 250th anniversary alongside major community milestones — 
 from Corning Incorporated’s 175th to Corning Museum of Glass’s 75th an
 d The Rockwell Museum’s 50th.\nThis year’s theme\, “Celebrating 250 
 | Our Nation\, Our Story\, Our Milestones\,” honors the shared history t
 hat shaped Corning.\nSpend the day exploring traditional craftsmen demonst
 rations\, live music\, hands‑on children’s activities\, farm animals\,
  homemade treats\, raffles\, food\, and special exhibits inspired by this 
 milestone year. The festival is free for kids and filled with family‑fri
 endly experiences that bring history to life.\nCome celebrate community\, 
 heritage\, and the stories that connect us!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https
 ://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78462623/20260926100000
