BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist-in-Residence Lecture | Priscilla Kar Yee Lo  @ CMoG
DTSTART:20261001T220000Z
DTEND:20261001T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260919T130751Z
UID:f568b9c413412f74e60ff4f197ba36436288f32d@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Glass
DESCRIPTION:Join us in The Studio Theater for Priscilla Kar Yee Lo's lectu
 re as part of her 2026 Diverse Expressions Residency where she will descri
 be her practice and residency project. Lo's work often carries a sense of 
 nostalgia and play while also asking questions about how women\, particula
 rly immigrant women\, are positioned within cultural and racial frameworks
 .\nThe residency will allow her to develop new processes that embrace unpr
 edictability\, distortion\, and fragility as active agents in reshaping id
 entity. By combining hot and kiln-formed glass\, she’ll use material tra
 nsformation to mirror the push and pull between control and surrender\, tr
 adition\, and self-determination.\nReservations for this event are not req
 uired. This lecture is free and open to the public.\nArtist presentations 
 reflect the individual artist's perspective\, practice\, and personal view
 s\, and do not represent an official position of the Corning Museum of Gla
 ss.\nPresentations may occasionally touch on personal\, sensitive\, or dif
 ficult subject matter.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o
 9b0uzpj/event/78466292/20261001180000
GEO:42.1498;77.0542
LOCATION:Corning Museum of Glass\, One Museum Way\, Corning\, NY\, 14830
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466292/20261001180000
END:VEVENT
