 ary - CCLD\n2nd St. Cemetery\, Elmira NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\nRegister
  in advance for this off-site program here: https://www.chemunglibraries.o
 rg/.../second-st-cemetery...\nJoin us on Saturday - October 3\, at 9:30 AM
  at the Old Second Street Cemetery in Elmira\, NY. We'll open with a gener
 al blessing for the cemetery followed by a brief talk on its history. You'
 ll then be welcome to walk in the cemetery. Visit long-lost ancestors or j
 ust enjoy the history of the site.\nAges 18+\nPARKING: Street parking is a
 vailable. Please respect parking guideline posted on the streets.\nMeeting
  Location:\nWe’ll meet at Old Second Street Cemetery\, at the College Av
 enue Gate (across from Weis Market) at 9:30am.\nPlease Note:\nThere are no
  restroom facilities at the site.\nDress for the weather and wear sturdy s
 hoes\; the ground may be uneven and grass may be slippery.\nBring your own
  water bottle.\nAccessibility note: This cemetery is not wheelchair access
 ible and may be challenging for individuals with limited mobility due to u
 neven terrain and lack of paved paths.\nWaiver Required:\nAll participants
  must sign a liability waiver before taking part in the program. Waivers w
 ill be available on site\, or you may request a copy in advance by contact
 ing Maggie at 607-733-9173 x2318 or emailing youngm@stls.org.\n\nSource: F
