DESCRIPTION:The Great Glass Pumpkin Experiment returns! Every Saturday\, S
 eptember 12–October 31*\, 10–11:30 am\, ghostly pumpkins\, dazzlingly 
 colorful pumpkins\, and even downright monstrous pumpkins take over the Am
 phitheater Hot Shop! Come watch our Hot Glass Team live in the Great Glass
  Pumpkin Experiment.\nWatch glassmakers Claire Cadorette work with Niko Di
 mitrijevic and fellow Hot Glass Team members on September 19. Inspired by 
 the exhibition Tough Stuff: Women in the American Glass Studio and the man
 y women artists who are also mothers\, Cadorette is making a baby sitting 
 in a pumpkin. "So many tough women in our community inspire me and advise 
 me as I continue to make work while pregnant with my first kid\," Cadorett
 e explains.\n* There is no Great Glass Pumpkin Experiment demo on October 
 17.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466
 296/20260919100000
