DESCRIPTION:Event by Southeast Steuben County Library and CareFirstNY\n300
  Nasser Civic Center Plaza\, Corning\, NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\nJoin Ca
 reFirstNY and the Southeast Steuben County Library for a meaningful evenin
 g honoring Día de los Muertos—the Day of the Dead—a traditional Mexic
 an holiday that celebrates and remembers loved ones who have passed away.
 \nThe library will feature a community Ofrenda (altar). All are welcome to
  contribute by bringing photos or small mementos of departed family member
 s\, friends\, or pets to be part of the display.\nThe evening will include
 :\n• Showing of Disney’s "Coco" (PG\, 1h 45m\, 2017)\n• Food & Candy
 \n• Button Making\n• Crafts\, activities\, & more!\nCome learn about t
 he rich cultural traditions behind this holiday and take part in a night o
 f remembrance\, reflection\, and community.\nRefreshments and activities a
 re free and open to all.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly
