 orseheads\n* October 16 - Pirozzolo Park\, West Elmira\n* October 23 - Hou
 ghton Land Preserve\, Corning\n* October 30 - Bradley Farms\, Elmira\nJoin
  us to explore new and familiar parks\, enjoy nature\, and learn while hav
 ing fun! Bring a water bottle\, sunscreen\, and your sense of adventure! W
 alks include an activity and a snack. Ticks are prevalent this year\, so d
